event={"id":"poland_events_2021_2023.nov21_konf","source":"source/scenes/poland_events_2021_2023.scene.dry:2303","proseGrade":"A","proseAudit":"The premise quotes the actual county-meeting and Telegram language (\"executioners\", \"foreign agents\") so the threat is specific rather than categorical, and expose, protect and dismiss each end in a different organisational fact.","historicalDate":"November 2021 — Rage is getting organised","factualBaseline":"Konfederacja organisers tie anti-vaccine messaging to anti-left rhetoric and abortion backlash. In county meetings and Telegram channels, doctors are called \"executioners,\" women's-strike volunteers \"foreign agents,\" and left councillors \"enemies of Polish families.\" The campaign frame is no longer only taxes and lockdowns. It is social conflict with named targets.","peopleIntroduced":[],"organisationsIntroduced":["Lewica","Konfederacja"],"requiredRole":"Lewica national leadership under the live constitutional role shown by the event","legalAuthority":"Authority is limited to the named office, chamber, party body or cabinet actor; party leadership cannot exercise another institution’s power.","availabilityConditions":"november_2021_konf_done = 0","choices":[{"id":"poland_events_2021_2023.nov21_konf_expose","title":"Expose the network and name the intimidation chain","subtitle":"Cost: 1 resource.","subtitleSource":"source","availabilityConditions":"resources >= 1 · The monitoring team lacks legal and media capacity.","authorityStage":"proposal","immediateConsequence":"resources -= 1; media_capacity += 3; constitutional_restraint += 2; feminist_trust += 2; minority_safety += 2; konf_poll_momentum -= 0.15; news_headline = \"Lewica publishes the anti-left intimidation chain behind Konfederacja's campaign\"","delayedCallbacks":["constitutional_restraint","feminist_trust","konf_poll_momentum","media_capacity","minority_safety","news_headline","resources"],"mediaPublicReception":["Lewica publishes the anti-left intim